{"schema":"stemrobin181/phase1-observation@1","phase":1,"batch":"D041","book":"10p","physical_range":[322,325],"printed_range":[312,315],"status":"FROZEN_SOURCE_ONLY_WITH_NARROW_GLYPH_AND_OPEN_BOUNDARY","column_convention":"1-based Unicode code points in stored lines, including LaTeX delimiters and explicit spacing; inclusive end","pages":[{"schema":"stemrobin181/source-observation@1","batch":"D041","book":"10p","physical_page":322,"printed_page":312,"source":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/10p/pages/0322/page.png","sha256":"9ba2d66e905015b84f3840c5078e4a4795254b00b67169bdec1c84846fbd4ea9","width_px":1536,"height_px":2337},"observation_basis":"First frozen observation plus only hash-bound affected clarification; initial bytes remain immutable","blocks":[{"id":"p0322#1","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":true,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["发，所给的能量只是增大了整个原子的动能。"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0322#2","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["用被电场加速的电子来轰击原子，从而给予原子一定的","能量是最简单的方法。电子通过电势差 $U$ 后，得到了动能","$\\frac{mv^2}{2}=eU$。"],"line_count":3,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0322#3","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["弗兰克和赫兹的实验如图 252 所示。在有三个电极的玻","璃管内在低气压下充满了水银蒸气，电源 1 产生加速电场。阴","极 $K$ 与栅极 $C$ 之间的电压 $U$ 可以用电位器来调整。在栅极和","阳极之间用电源 2 产生电压约为 0.5 伏的弱阻碍电场。电场","阻止低速电子射入阳极。电子是由加热的阴极 $K$ 发射出来","的。"],"line_count":6,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0322#4","kind":"fig","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":[],"line_count":0,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"figure_id":"fig-252"},{"id":"p0322#5","kind":"fig","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":[],"line_count":0,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"figure_id":"fig-253"},{"id":"p0322#6","kind":"cap","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["图 252"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"figure_id":"fig-252"},{"id":"p0322#7","kind":"cap","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":true},"lines":["图 253"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"figure_id":"fig-253"},{"id":"p0322#8","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["用实验求出阳极电路中的电流强度 $I$ 与电压 $U$ 间的关","系。所得的曲线如图 253 所示，电流强度在电压为 4.9 伏时","达到第一个最大值。随后而来的是电流强度的急剧下降。在","电压为 9.8 伏时获得第二个最大值，依此类推。$I$ 对 $U$ 的这","种依赖关系只能用水银原子稳定态的存在来解释。"],"line_count":5,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0322#9","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":true,"samerow":false},"lines":["当电压低于 4.9 伏时，电子和原子的碰撞是弹性的。原","子的内能不改变，因为电子质量比水银原子质量小得多，所以","在这种情况下电子的动能几乎不变。结果被阴极和栅极间电","场加速了的电子克服了阻碍电场，到达阳极，单位时间内到"],"line_count":4,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0322#10","kind":"foot","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["· 312 ·"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]}],"figures":[{"id":"fig-252","block":"p0322#4","approx_native_box_xywh":[225,1000,495,305],"inventory":{"composition":"One circuit/apparatus diagram, not two panels.","labels":["K","C","A","V","mA","电源1","电源2"],"objects":["Horizontal glass tube; heated cathode K at left with two external leads.","Dashed vertical grid C near right; solid anode A beyond grid.","mA circle in anode branch; V circle bridging cathode and grid branch.","Adjustable resistor rectangle below; downward slider contact from upper wire.","Lower power-source-1 battery branch and right power-source-2 battery branch with alternating long/short plates and dotted continuation."],"relationships":["K on left, C between K and A.","Voltmeter across cathode/grid potential; milliammeter in anode circuit.","Slider wire joins resistor from above; connected junctions shown by filled dots."],"printed_given_values":[]}},{"id":"fig-253","b