wo captions share one baseline."},"boundaries":[{"type":"continuation","number":123,"from":"p0321#7","to":"p0322#1","join_literal":"原子将不被激发，所给的能量只是增大了整个原子的动能。","status":"paragraph_closed_not_unit_closed"},{"type":"right_open","number":123,"block":"p0322#9","line":4,"after":"到","status":"resolved_by_actual_p0323#1","continuation":"p0323#1"}],"holds":[],"image_usage":{"local_open_ordinal":1,"kind":"original","reopen":false},"approval":"SOURCE first observation only; no RAW/modern/card approval","initial_snapshot":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1817-source322325-review/source0322.freeze.json","sha256":"9bb8a859277cbfa2ac484bb9eebf41d90de15c5aa134a3f534a676ae4a7353f1"}},{"schema":"stemrobin181/source-observation@1","batch":"D041","book":"10p","physical_page":323,"printed_page":313,"source":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/10p/pages/0323/page.png","sha256":"c0e59d9423a06fb7997b86cfc4d9e9fb477bef9e75e21167357664472ac3652e","width_px":1536,"height_px":2337},"observation_basis":"First frozen observation plus only hash-bound affected clarification; initial bytes remain immutable","column_convention":"1-based Unicode code points in stored lines, including LaTeX delimiters and spaces; no normalization after this freeze.","blocks":[{"id":"p0323#1","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":true,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["达阳极的电子数与电压成正比地增长。"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0323#2","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["当电压提高到 4.9 伏时，电子和原子的碰撞就变为非弹","性的了。原子的内能跳跃地增长，而在碰撞后电子几乎失去","自己全部的动能。阻碍电场不允许低速电子到达阳极，电流","强度就急剧减小。电流没有降到零是由于一部分电子没有受","到非弹性碰撞而到达了栅极。"],"line_count":5,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0323#3","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["电子只有在通过电位差 4.9 伏以后到达栅极才能得到作","非弹性碰撞所必需的能量。由此可见，水银原子内能的变化","数值不能小于 $\\Delta E=4.9$ 电子伏特。因此，原子的内能就不能","取任意值，也不能作任意数值的变化：这就证明了原子的稳","定态① 是不连续的。"],"line_count":5,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0323#3","line":2,"column_1based":18},"end":{"block":"p0323#3","line":3,"column_1based_inclusive":27},"text":"水银原子内能的变化\n数值不能小于 $\\Delta E=4.9$ 电子伏特。"},{"start":{"block":"p0323#3","line":4,"column_1based":26},"end":{"block":"p0323#3","line":5,"column_1based_inclusive":2},"text":"稳\n定态"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0323#4","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["这个结论的正确性还有如下材料作证明：即当电压为 4.9","伏时，水银蒸汽就开始辐射。辐射频率按公式 $\\nu=\\frac{\\Delta E}{h}$ 计算，其","数值与实验观察出的数值相符。这就表明，被激发的水银原","子随后向较低能态跃迁并辐射出与玻尔第二个假设一致的光","量子。"],"line_count":5,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Literal source prints 蒸汽 here; do not harmonize with 蒸气 on p0322."]},{"id":"p0323#5","kind":"h3","number":124,"flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["124.　玻尔理论的困难　量子力学"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0323#5","line":1,"column_1based":1},"end":{"block":"p0323#5","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":17},"text":"124.　玻尔理论的困难　量子力学"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0323#6","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["玻尔理论的最大成绩在于对氢原子的运用，使建立氢原子光谱的","定量理论成为可能。"],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0323#7","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["但是在玻尔概念的基础上企图建立氦后面的氢原子的定量理论没","有成功。对于氦原子和更复杂一些的原子，玻尔理论只能作一些定性","的（虽然是极重要的）结论。"],"line_count":3,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Native crop confirms literal wording in source0323.clarification.freeze.json. Unusual printed run is retained, not grammar-corrected."]},{"id":"p0323#8","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false,"footnote":true},"lines":["①　图 253 中曲线的第二个最大值是由于在电压为 9.8 伏时电子在飞向栅","极的途中遇到两次非弹性碰撞的结果。"],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],