:5,"after":"量子。","footnote":"p0323#8","evidence":"Actual following numbered 124 heading, not TOC."},{"type":"numbered_start","number":124,"block":"p0323#5","title":"玻尔理论的困难　量子力学"},{"type":"unit_open","number":124,"block":"p0323#7","after":"结论。","status":"resolved_by_actual_p0324#4_number125_heading","end_block":"p0324#3","end_line":10}],"holds":[{"id":"323-frequency-glyph-nu-v","phase":"SOURCE formula glyph","status":"HOLD","scope":{"block":"p0323#4","line":2,"shape":"single small glyph before equals"},"candidate_latex":["\\nu","v"],"reason":"Contour retained; no semantic guess. No additional image open is requested or authorized."}],"image_usage":{"local_open_ordinal":2,"kind":"original","reopen":false},"approval":"SOURCE first observation with narrowly scoped glyph HOLD; no RAW/modern/card approval","initial_snapshot":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1817-source322325-review/source0323.freeze.json","sha256":"23383c468ecf37329c82e83406c1e7007e3e220558507b9a37dd0eb79d46f7c2"},"clarification":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1817-source322325-review/source0323.clarification.freeze.json","sha256":"b6c39c50130051f77000915f24661bc3626f7ff51607c77c7d0f5a31bc00292a"}},{"schema":"stemrobin181/source-observation@1","batch":"D041","book":"10p","physical_page":324,"printed_page":314,"source":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/10p/pages/0324/page.png","sha256":"70453e8ebabb61bfe6db1853e4ab0d25f0c6ecfddb2626301c4c35c726308bb9","width_px":1536,"height_px":2337},"observation_basis":"First frozen observation plus only hash-bound affected clarification; initial bytes remain immutable","column_convention":"1-based Unicode code points in stored lines, including spaces and any LaTeX syntax.","blocks":[{"id":"p0324#1","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["这并不奇怪。玻尔理论是不彻底的，有内在的矛盾。一方面，如我","们所看到的，在建立氢原子理论时用的是牛顿力学的一般原理及众所","周知的库仑定律；另一方面，引用了与牛顿力学和麦克斯韦电动力学没","有丝毫联系的量子假设。量子概念引入物理学中，要求根本地改造力","学和电动力学。这个改造在本世纪二十年代末实现了，当时建立了新","的物理学理论：量子力学和量子电动力学。"],"line_count":6,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0324#2","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["玻尔的假设终于被证实是完全正确的。但是它们已经不作为假设","出现，而是作为这些理论的基本原则的结果而出现；玻尔的量子化规则","是近似的结果，远非总是能应用的。"],"line_count":3,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0324#3","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["关于玻尔所说的在原子中电子在确定的轨道上运动的概念是十分","有条件的。事实上原子中电子的运动与行星沿轨道的运动极少有共同","点。如果处于最低能级的氢原子能有较长的曝光时间拍摄下来，则我","们可以看到的将是在离核一定距离上具有最大密度的云状物。可以把","这个距离看作是轨道半径的粗略近似。这个距离恰好与玻尔半径一致","（11.8）。原子的照片完全不像太阳系常见的画面，而是比较象给一只","对着灯乱撞的蝴蝶照相时照下来的轮廓模糊的斑点①。现在利用量子","力学可以回答涉及到原子的电子云的属性和结构的任何问题，但是定","量的理论是极其复杂的，所以我们不打算涉及它，在《无机化学》课程","中有关于原子的电子云的性质的描写。"],"line_count":10,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Literal 象 is preserved; circled ① owns the page-bottom note."]},{"id":"p0324#4","kind":"h3","number":125,"flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["125.　量子光源——激光器"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0324#4","line":1,"column_1based":1},"end":{"block":"p0324#4","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":14},"text":"125.　量子光源——激光器"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0324#5","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["感应辐射　1917 年爱因斯坦预言了用原子感应（受激）辐射光的可","能性。感应辐射一词可理解为在入射光的作用下被激发的原子的辐","射。这种射线突出的特点是：在感应辐射时产生的光波与入射到原子","上的光波无论在频率、相位或极化作用上都没有区别。"],"line_count":4,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0324#5","line":1,"column_1based":1},"end":{"block":"p0324#5","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":4},"text":"感应辐射"},{"start":{"block":"p0324#5","line":1,"column_1based":22},"end":{"block":"p0324#5","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":23},"text":"感应"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0324#5","line":4,"column_1based":7},"end":{"block":"p0324#5","line":4,"column_1based_inclusive":9},"text":"在频率"},{"start":{"block":"p0324#5","line":4,"column_1based":11},"end":{"block":"p0324#5","line":4,"column_1based_inclusive":12},"text":"相位"},{"start":{"block":"p0324#5","line":4,"column_1based":14},"end":{"block":"p0324#5","line":4,"column_1based_inclusive":17},"text":"极化作用"}]},{"id":"p0324#6","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false,"footnote":true},"lines":["①　这里应当注意到，在比较长的时间的曝光下才能得到画面的平均相似","物。电子的运动无论如何不能和蝴蝶的飞舞等同，如同与任何其它宏观物体的","运动不能等同一样。"],"line_count":3,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"owner_number":124,"owner_marker":{"block":"p0324#3","line":7,"text":"①"},"notes":["Printed marker identifies 124 ownership despite note below 125 heading."]},{"id":"p0324#7","kind":"foot","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["· 314 ·"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]}],"figures":[],"formula_shapes":[],"printed_numeric_glyphs":[{"block":"p0324#3","line":6,"text":"（11.8）","shape":"Two 1 stems, decimal dot, two-loop 8 between parentheses; source equation reference, not a new equation."},{"block":"p0324#5","line":1,"text":"1917","shape":"Baseline four-digit year, not exponent."}],"typography":{"ordinary_scope":"All body and footnote outside listed bold runs; no page-wide weight HOLD.","underdot_inventory":{"status":"complete","dotted_columns":[7,8,9,11,12,14,15,16,17],"undotted_intervening_columns":[{"column":10,"text":"、"},{"column":13,"text":"或"}],"maximality":"Separate adjacent dotted-character runs; first dot belongs to 在, last to 用. No dots under preceding 论, trailing 上, internal 、 or 或. Do not mark the entire enclosing phrase as continuously dotted."}},"line_accounting":{"body":23,"heading":1,"footnote":3,"foot":1,"block_line_sum":28,"samerow_deduction":0,"unique_physical_lines":28,"basis":"6+3+10 ordinary-body rows, one heading, four 125 body rows, three note rows, page number; separator rule excluded."},"boundaries":[{"type":"numbered_continuation","number":124,"block":"p0324#1","paragraph_cont":false,"reason":"Prior paragraph closed; this page begins a fresh paragraph in the same numbered object."},{"type":"numbered_end","number":124,"block":"p0324#3","line":10,"after":"描写。","footnote":"p0324#6","evidence":"Actual following 125 heading."},{"type":"numbered_start","number":125,"block":"p0324#4","title":"量子光源——激光器"},{"type":"unit_open","number":125,"block":"p0324#5","after":"区别。","status":"continued_on_p0325; final125_boundary_remains_open"}],"holds":[],"image_usage":{"local_open_ordinal":3,"kind":"original","reopen":false},"approval":"SOURCE first observation only; narrow underdot endpoint HOLD; no RAW/modern/card approval","initial_snapshot":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1817-source322325-review/source0324.freeze.json","sha256":"61bca92253a2dc8fd49da2360a78ccaa06b134ac8c5cc09c7d8f57543d021521"},"clarification":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1817-source322325-review/source0324.clarification.freeze.json","sha256":"f2fb92518f67f31e628275f0b134931786e97e528ea87bb085c0e2cfebb5bb56"}},{"schema":"stemrobin181/source-observation@1","batch":"D041","book":"10p","physical_page":325,"printed_page":315,"source":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/10p/pages/0325/page.png","sha256":"4c754f093af9a61cbb3b9fdf79654e2e7eba138720adc2e95e191d4890d840d6","width_px":1536,"height_px":2337},"observation_basis":"First frozen observation plus only hash-bound affected clarification; initial bytes remain immutable","column_convention":"1-based Unicode code points of stored lines, including spaces and LaTeX syntax.","blocks":[{"id":"p0325#1","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["用量子论的语言来说，受激辐射意味着原子从高能状态跃到低","能状态，但这不是象一般辐射中那样自发产生的，而是在外界作用的影","响下发生的。"],"line_count":3,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0325#2","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["激光　1940 年苏联物理学家 В·А·法布里康特指出了利用受激辐","射现象来放大电磁波的可能性。1954 年苏联科学家 Н·Г·巴索夫和 А·","М·普罗霍洛夫与美国物理学家 ч·达瑞斯各自独立地用感应辐射现象","制成了波长 $\\lambda=1.27$ 厘米的无线电微波振荡器。由于创立了无线电波","发生和放大的新原理，Н·Г·巴索夫及 А·М·普罗霍洛夫于 1959 年获得","了列宁奖金。1963 年 Н·Г·巴索夫、А·М·普罗霍洛夫和 Ч·达瑞斯被","授予诺贝尔奖金。"],"line_count":7,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0325#2","line":1,"column_1based":1},"end":{"block":"p0325#2","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":2},"text":"激光"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Literal years retained without historical correction.","Name initials use Cyrillic code-point convention for visually indistinguishable uppercase homoglyphs. Native crop confirms smaller lowercase initial on line3 and uppercase on line6; surname unchanged."]},{"id":"p0325#3","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["1960 年美国制成了第一台激光器——在可见光范围内的电磁波量","子振荡器。"],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Dense final 量 glyph is local ink density, not a certain separate bold run."]},{"id":"p0325#4","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["激光辐射的特性　激光光源与其他光源相比具有一系列本质上的","优越性："],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0325#4","line":1,"column_1based":1},"end":{"block":"p0325#4","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":7},"text":"激光辐射的特性"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0325#5","kind":"p","enumeration_label":"1.","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["1.　激光能够产生散射角度约 $10^{-5}$ 弧度的极细的光束。从地球上","射向月球的这样的光束可以产生直径仅为 3 公里的斑点。"],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Numbered exposition point, not an exercise."]},{"id":"p0325#6","kind":"p","enumeration_label":"2.","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["2.　激光具有特殊的单色性。与一般光源不同，在激光器中原子辐","射光是一致的，而一般的光源原子辐射的光是互不相关的，所以在激","光中波的相位不发生无规则的变化。"],"line_count":3,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0325#7","kind":"p","enumeration_label":"3.","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["3.　激光器是最强大的光源。在光谱很窄的间隔中，在很短的时间","内（$10^{-11}$ 秒）每平方厘米辐射功率可达 $10^{12}$——$10^{13}$ 瓦特，而在这时间","内太阳在每平方厘米的辐射功率仅仅等于 $7\\times10^3$ 瓦特，并且是整个光","谱的功率的总和。而在很窄的间隔 $\\Delta\\lambda=10^{-6}$ 厘米（即激光光谱线的宽","度）太阳的辐射功率只有 0.2 瓦特/厘米$^2$。在激光器辐射的电磁波中，","电场强度是 $10^{10}$——$10^{12}$ 伏/厘米。它超过了原子内部的电场强度。"],"line_count":6,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[],"notes":["Literal magnitudes, units and range strokes preserved; no correction by physical plausibility."]},{"id":"p0325#8","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["激光的作用原理　在通常条件下，大多数原子处于低能量状态，所","以在低温时物体不发光。"],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[{"start":{"block":"p0325#8","line":1,"column_1based":1},"end":{"block":"p0325#8","line":1,"column_1based_inclusive":7},"text":"激光的作用原理"}],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0325#9","kind":"p","flags":{"cont":false,"open":true,"samerow":false},"lines":["当电磁波通过物体时，发生电磁能量的吸收。在波的能量作用下，","一部分原子被激发，即跃迁到较高能量状态。这时从光束中获得的能"],"line_count":2,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]},{"id":"p0325#10","kind":"foot","flags":{"cont":false,"open":false,"samerow":false},"lines":["· 315 ·"],"line_count":1,"heavy_spans_certain":[],"under_dot_spans_certain":[]}],"figures":[],"formula_shapes":[{"block":"p0325#2","line":4,"latex":"\\lambda=1.27","shape":"Slanted lambda with high left-to-right descending stroke and rising lower-left branch; two-stroke equals; 1 dot 2 7 on baseline."},{"block":"p0325#5","line":1,"latex":"10^{-5}","shape":"Baseline 1 and closed oval 0; raised short horizontal minus and 5 with top bar and lower bowl. Minus is not baseline subtraction."},{"block":"p0325#7","line":2,"latex":["10^{-11}","10^{12}","10^{13}"],"shape":"First raised exponent is short minus plus two 1 stems; power-range endpoints have raised 12 and 13. Between endpoint numbers is a long continuous dash/range stroke, encoded as source —— outside math."},{"block":"p0325#7","line":3,"latex":"7\\times10^3","shape":"Baseline 7, crossing oblique strokes forming multiplication sign, baseline 10, raised 3 with two curved lobes."},{"block":"p0325#7","line":4,"latex":"\\Delta\\lambda=10^{-6}","shape":"Closed triangular capital delta adjacent to branching lambda; two-stroke equals; raised short minus and looped 6 over baseline 10."},{"block":"p0325#7","line":5,"latex":"^2","shape":"Raised 2 immediately after 厘米; printed slash before 厘米, not a horizontal fraction bar."},{"block":"p0325#7","line":6,"latex":["10^{10}","10^{12}"],"shape":"Baseline 10 with raised 10 and raised 12 respectively; long dash range separator; source unit is 伏/厘米."}],"typography":{"underdot_inventory":"none","body_outside_listed_spans":"ordinary; complete heavy inventory, no additional heavy run"},"line_accounting":{"body":29,"foot":1,"block_line_sum":30,"samerow_deduction":0,"unique_physical_lines":30,"basis":"3+7+2+2+2+3+6+2+2 body rows, one page-number row; no figures or extra heading rows."},"boundaries":[{"type":"numbered_continuation","number":125,"block":"p0325#1","paragraph_cont":false},{"type":"right_open","number":125,"block":"p0325#9","line":2,"after":"能","status":"actual_sentence_and_numbered_object_open; no next heading on page"}],"holds":[{"id":"325-right-open","phase":"SOURCE object boundary","status":"OPEN","scope":{"number":125,"block":"p0325#9","line":2,"after":"能"},"reason":"Printed page cuts sentence after 能; no source326 read is authorized."}],"image_usage":{"local_open_ordinal":4,"kind":"original","reopen":false},"approval":"SOURCE first observation only; no RAW/modern/card approval","initial_snapshot":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-181-resume/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-181/tmp/d1817-source322325-review/source0325.freeze.json","sha256":"4e8830c48323f5940f04443695d4f2d0e8338cdadad6f9bdc27a8436c4c9c393"},"clarification":{"path":"/U